{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Killer is a frantic 2D bullet hell where love defies Death. You play as Astrid, a woman armed with a devastating minigun who descends into the Dungeon of Death to face six infernal mistresses and demand her husband\u2019s life back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971510/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1774067162\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971510/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1774067162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971510/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1774067162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending a gothic, anime, and grunge aesthetic with fast-paced horizontal and vertical shoot \u2019em up action, Dungeon Killer delivers more than just intense gameplay. Its emotional core, a story of love, grief, and defiance, builds toward a shocking, fourth-wall-breaking ending that challenges the player long after the game is over.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971510?t=1774067162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971510?t=1774067162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971510/46eab05b697b4b300e21be3fdca5906325ab821c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774067162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971510/46eab05b697b4b300e21be3fdca5906325ab821c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774067162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":